1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,947
Don't think Vice City is just a city in Grand Theft Auto.

2
00:00:03,997 --> 00:00:06,573
Vice City has a team in the NBA.

3
00:00:06,623 --> 00:00:09,000
And one of the best players in the world.

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:14,832
Vice City is based on a real city: Miami. And Miami's NBA team is the Miami Heat.

5
00:00:14,882 --> 00:00:24,009
It started in 2017, when the Heat wore a jersey called Vice, inspired by the show Miami Vice. It became one of the best-selling jerseys in the league.

6
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:30,329
Tonight, one day before Grand Theft Auto 6 drops, the Heat host "A Night in Vice City," with Rockstar.

7
00:00:30,379 --> 00:00:36,598
A one-night-only court, black and pink jerseys with Travis Scott, and a fan version that says Vice City.

8
00:00:36,648 --> 00:00:39,494
Even the arena roof now reads Vice City.

9
00:00:39,544 --> 00:00:46,115
Their best player? Giannis Antetokounmpo. Two-time MVP and 2021 NBA champion.

10
00:00:46,165 --> 00:00:51,454
He joined the Heat this summer, and his first Vice City night is against his old team, Milwaukee.

11
00:00:51,504 --> 00:00:57,218
So tomorrow, you're in Vice City playing GTA. But tonight, Vice City plays basketball.
